              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋiboro ŋulu emaikina ikes todaka ikes lu: Ŋakito ŋuna edukununuere neni iwuanakinio Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet, kaapei ka ŋasuwa keŋ ka ŋipirin ta ŋakito ŋuna epetanakinio kwap, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
