          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋipirin daadaŋ ŋulu ka alapatu a ŋina erimokinit eema, ŋakito ŋuna epetanakinio kwap, ŋases ka ŋaunoi kaapei ka ŋiboro daadaŋ ŋulu isitiyao a nen ta akitiya ŋiticisyo daadaŋ ŋulu emaikina ikes kitiyata a ŋiboro a ŋul. Ikorakini iyoŋ ŋolokile ŋiboro ŋulu emaikina iŋes todak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
